WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

00:00.631 --> 00:04.501 align:center line:79%
Dear youth, what a beautiful
conference session we are having!

00:04.902 --> 00:08.672 align:center line:79%
We have already heard three
living Apostles of Jesus Christ.

00:08.839 --> 00:11.875 align:center line:81%
What a wonderful blessing! And we will

00:11.875 --> 00:15.412 align:center line:79%
still hear one more:
Elder Henry B. Eyring.

00:15.679 --> 00:17.915 align:center line:81%
The spiritual feast continues!

00:18.749 --> 00:20.617 align:center line:81%
When I spoke last year,

00:20.617 --> 00:25.889 align:center line:79%
we learned how to face this world
through David's experience with Goliath.

00:26.189 --> 00:27.858 align:center line:81%
Remember the five stones?

00:28.358 --> 00:34.097 align:center line:79%
Well, today I'm sharing an Old Testament
story I read at your age,

00:34.398 --> 00:38.235 align:center line:79%
which left me wanting
to be like its protagonist.

00:38.835 --> 00:41.405 align:center line:81%
The Bible does not tell us her name,

00:41.405 --> 00:47.244 align:center line:79%
so we will call her the woman of Shunem
because this is the name of her town.

00:48.211 --> 00:52.583 align:center line:79%
One day, the prophet
Elisha was passing through Shunem,

00:52.883 --> 01:00.290 align:center line:79%
and we read that “[there] was a great
woman; and she [invited] him to eat bread.

01:00.924 --> 01:07.598 align:center line:79%
And so it was that as oft[en] as he passed
by, he turned in ... to eat bread.”

01:08.465 --> 01:10.567 align:center line:81%
I imagine the prophet Elisha was

01:10.567 --> 01:13.604 align:center line:79%
so happy with the invitation
to eat at her house!

01:14.471 --> 01:20.344 align:center line:79%
He had already gone several times when
one day the woman said to her husband,

01:21.111 --> 01:26.583 align:center line:79%
“Now, I perceive that this
is [a] holy man of God.”

01:27.651 --> 01:31.488 align:center line:79%
The woman says, “Now, I
perceive.” It seems

01:31.488 --> 01:37.227 align:center line:79%
she invited Elisha to her house
without knowing he was the prophet;

01:37.594 --> 01:43.100 align:center line:79%
she receives her testimony through
the Holy Ghost by listening carefully

01:43.100 --> 01:46.103 align:center line:81%
to what Elisha said and taught.

01:46.670 --> 01:49.840 align:center line:79%
(Remember, there were no
pictures at that time!

01:49.840 --> 01:53.477 align:center line:79%
So it was hard to recognize
the prophet just by his face.)

01:54.277 --> 01:56.546 align:center line:81%
But the story does not end there.

01:56.913 --> 02:00.050 align:center line:81%
One day, the woman said to her husband,

02:00.450 --> 02:07.357 align:center line:79%
“Let us make a little chamber ... and let
us set for him there a bed, and a table,

02:07.624 --> 02:10.260 align:center line:81%
and a stool, and a candlestick:

02:10.627 --> 02:16.700 align:center line:79%
and it shall be, [that] when he cometh
to us, that he shall turn

02:16.700 --> 02:23.340 align:center line:79%
in.” This faithful woman was willing
to build a room in her house,

02:23.640 --> 02:28.945 align:center line:79%
so that the prophet, passing through
the city, would have a place to stay.

02:29.946 --> 02:34.051 align:center line:79%
Today, we can learn a powerful
lesson from this experience.

02:34.985 --> 02:41.291 align:center line:79%
The Lord testified to the woman of Shunem
that Elisha was a prophet of God,

02:41.725 --> 02:46.229 align:center line:79%
and she acted by opening
her house to receive him.

02:47.197 --> 02:52.836 align:center line:79%
We too can receive a personal testimony
of God's prophets today,

02:53.470 --> 02:57.774 align:center line:81%
and open our hearts and minds—our house—

02:57.974 --> 03:03.513 align:center line:79%
to the message that our Heavenly Father
has for us in these latter days.

03:04.715 --> 03:06.850 align:center line:81%
Dear youth, I invite you

03:06.850 --> 03:13.657 align:center line:79%
to ask yourself this question:
Do I have a personal testimony

03:13.790 --> 03:16.126 align:center line:81%
of God's living prophets?

03:17.160 --> 03:18.829 align:center line:81%
Let's start at the beginning.

03:18.829 --> 03:26.169 align:center line:79%
What is a prophet? A prophet is a man
whom God has called to speak for Him.

03:26.803 --> 03:32.075 align:center line:79%
There are prophets on the earth today,
just as there were in ancient times.

03:33.009 --> 03:36.113 align:center line:81%
Prophets are seers and revelators.

03:36.513 --> 03:40.517 align:center line:79%
That means they can see
what others cannot see,

03:40.717 --> 03:43.820 align:center line:81%
and they can prophesy of future events.

03:44.588 --> 03:47.224 align:center line:81%
They can also prepare us for calamities.

03:47.924 --> 03:51.862 align:center line:79%
Prophets receive commandments
and revelations from God.

03:53.230 --> 03:57.801 align:center line:79%
The ninth article of faith speaks
of the continuing revelation

03:57.801 --> 04:04.007 align:center line:79%
in these last days. It says,
“We believe all that God has revealed,

04:04.207 --> 04:06.710 align:center line:81%
all that he does now reveal,

04:06.910 --> 04:11.481 align:center line:79%
and we believe that He will yet
reveal many great

04:11.481 --> 04:15.619 align:center line:79%
and important things pertaining
to the kingdom of God.”

04:16.820 --> 04:19.089 align:center line:81%
Elder Gary E. Stevenson said,

04:19.790 --> 04:23.260 align:center line:79%
“The Lord continues to
reveal His commandments

04:23.260 --> 04:25.462 align:center line:81%
and will to His prophet today

04:25.862 --> 04:30.367 align:center line:79%
because He desires
to lead us to happiness in this life

04:30.567 --> 04:33.837 align:center line:81%
and to celestial glory in the next life.”

04:35.472 --> 04:40.010 align:center line:79%
Prophets also proclaim the gospel
and are inspired teachers

04:40.010 --> 04:44.080 align:center line:79%
and messengers
of God to everyone on earth.

04:44.915 --> 04:47.317 align:center line:81%
Each member of the First Presidency

04:47.317 --> 04:53.890 align:center line:79%
and the Quorum of the Twelve Apostles
is a prophet, seer, and revelator.

04:54.658 --> 04:58.195 align:center line:79%
Serving as a council
under the Lord’s direction,

04:58.395 --> 05:02.699 align:center line:79%
they have the authority to declare
and interpret doctrine

05:02.999 --> 05:06.102 align:center line:81%
and establish policy for His Church.

05:06.903 --> 05:09.573 align:center line:81%
They carefully pray and deliberate,

05:09.673 --> 05:14.211 align:center line:79%
for the decisions of these quorums
must be unanimous.

05:14.544 --> 05:20.116 align:center line:79%
In this way, the Lord assures
us that His will will be done.

05:21.184 --> 05:27.224 align:center line:79%
Prophets testify of Christ—His existence,
His ministry, and His divinity.

05:27.791 --> 05:31.561 align:center line:79%
Let us read some testimonies
of the prophets from the Book of Mormon.

05:32.195 --> 05:38.235 align:center line:79%
Abinadi proclaimed: “God himself
shall come down among the children of men

05:38.235 --> 05:40.237 align:center line:81%
and shall redeem his people.

05:40.770 --> 05:46.576 align:center line:79%
And because he dwelleth in flesh,
he shall be called the Son of God.”

05:47.210 --> 05:53.149 align:center line:79%
Samuel the Lamanite also testified
that Jesus Christ is “the Son of God,

05:53.650 --> 05:56.353 align:center line:81%
the Father of heaven and of earth,

05:56.686 --> 06:00.357 align:center line:79%
the Creator of all
things from the beginning.”

06:00.957 --> 06:05.395 align:center line:79%
And the prophet Moroni said,
“I have seen Jesus,

06:05.729 --> 06:10.033 align:center line:79%
and ... he hath talked with
me face to face.”

06:10.800 --> 06:12.936 align:center line:81%
When Christ visited the Nephites,

06:12.969 --> 06:18.341 align:center line:79%
one of the first things
He did was call twelve apostles.

06:18.541 --> 06:21.978 align:center line:79%
And He said to the people,
“Blessed are ye

06:22.112 --> 06:28.685 align:center line:79%
if ye shall give heed unto the words
of these twelve whom I have chosen.”

06:29.819 --> 06:33.223 align:center line:81%
Now, let me share a few words for parents

06:33.223 --> 06:35.992 align:center line:81%
or other family members raising children.

06:37.193 --> 06:42.832 align:center line:79%
The Lord Himself taught Adam and Eve
the truth of the plan of salvation.

06:43.266 --> 06:44.901 align:center line:81%
And then He said to them,

06:45.402 --> 06:52.275 align:center line:79%
“I give unto you a commandment to teach
these things freely unto your children.”

06:53.209 --> 06:55.578 align:center line:81%
What does it mean to teach freely?

06:56.479 --> 07:01.985 align:center line:79%
It is learning the truth of the gospel,
having a personal testimony of them,

07:02.319 --> 07:05.755 align:center line:79%
and sharing that knowledge
with our children.

07:06.423 --> 07:10.794 align:center line:79%
It is to promote both formal
and informal teaching moments.

07:11.194 --> 07:16.032 align:center line:79%
It is living according
to that knowledge and testimony.

07:16.967 --> 07:23.406 align:center line:79%
The Book of Mormon describes the 2,060
stripling warriors as “men of truth

07:23.406 --> 07:28.478 align:center line:79%
and soberness, for they had been taught
to keep the commandments of God

07:28.511 --> 07:31.715 align:center line:81%
and to walk uprightly before him.”

07:32.415 --> 07:35.952 align:center line:81%
These young men faithfully obeyed Helaman,

07:35.952 --> 07:40.991 align:center line:79%
who at that time was their military
leader and also their prophet,

07:41.558 --> 07:47.397 align:center line:79%
and they recognized that their mothers
had filled their hearts with truth

07:47.397 --> 07:48.398 align:center line:81%
and faith.

07:49.265 --> 07:55.171 align:center line:79%
Parents, in this world where there are
many voices and sometimes much darkness,

07:55.505 --> 08:03.880 align:center line:79%
God Himself has commanded us
to raise our children in light and truth.

08:04.280 --> 08:10.420 align:center line:79%
He entrusted us with the responsibility
to teach our children the saving truth

08:10.420 --> 08:17.560 align:center line:79%
of the gospel. If we fail to do so,
the world will not do it.

08:18.862 --> 08:22.098 align:center line:79%
Dear young friends,
I have an invitation for you:

08:22.799 --> 08:25.902 align:center line:81%
In the coming days, I invite you to kneel,

08:26.236 --> 08:31.341 align:center line:79%
open your hearts, and pray
with faith to Heavenly Father,

08:31.341 --> 08:36.212 align:center line:79%
asking Him to confirm
to you that His chosen prophet

08:36.212 --> 08:40.483 align:center line:81%
and apostles are His voice on the earth

08:40.483 --> 08:41.484 align:center line:81%
today.

08:42.419 --> 08:46.289 align:center line:79%
The woman of Shunem taught us
that we can have that testimony

08:46.322 --> 08:47.557 align:center line:81%
through the Holy Ghost.

08:48.091 --> 08:54.330 align:center line:79%
And I promise you that once we know
they are God's anointed ones,

08:54.497 --> 08:59.836 align:center line:79%
our life will be easier
in spite of our ongoing challenges,

09:00.270 --> 09:05.575 align:center line:79%
as we will obey their voice
with trust, faith, and hope.

09:06.376 --> 09:11.414 align:center line:79%
To listen and to obey the voice
of the prophet is crucial to holding

09:11.414 --> 09:16.753 align:center line:79%
on unto every good thing until
the Second Coming of our Savior.

09:18.054 --> 09:20.657 align:center line:81%
The world's wickedness is growing,

09:20.957 --> 09:26.129 align:center line:79%
but the Church of Jesus Christ
and His kingdom are stronger than ever.

09:26.763 --> 09:33.703 align:center line:79%
Zion is putting on its beautiful garments,
and Christ's throne will not fall.

09:34.604 --> 09:40.110 align:center line:79%
The Lord expects us to be strong
in our testimonies, to be full of faith,

09:40.110 --> 09:43.980 align:center line:79%
and to repent daily.
Our Savior Jesus Christ

09:43.980 --> 09:47.851 align:center line:79%
is counting on each
of us to carry on his work.

09:48.718 --> 09:52.622 align:center line:79%
Once the Prophet Joseph Smith
said, “Brethren,

09:52.622 --> 09:55.225 align:center line:81%
shall we not go on in so great a cause?”

09:55.658 --> 09:59.028 align:center line:79%
However, since this message is mainly
for you, the youth,

09:59.262 --> 10:03.233 align:center line:79%
I would like to use the word
“youth” instead of “brethren.”

10:03.366 --> 10:04.367 align:center line:81%
Ready?

10:05.168 --> 10:09.272 align:center line:79%
“[Youth], shall we not
go on in so great a cause?

10:09.305 --> 10:12.108 align:center line:81%
Go forward, and not backward.

10:12.342 --> 10:16.179 align:center line:79%
Courage, [youth]; and on,
on to the victory!

10:16.513 --> 10:20.717 align:center line:79%
Let your hearts rejoice
and be exceedingly glad.”

10:21.751 --> 10:24.354 align:center line:81%
I am grateful for the guidance

10:24.687 --> 10:28.258 align:center line:79%
and the consecrated efforts
of the living prophets.

10:29.159 --> 10:36.900 align:center line:79%
And I give you my solemn testimony that
they are called by God to carry forth,

10:37.300 --> 10:44.674 align:center line:79%
establish, and lead his kingdom
on earth today. And it will always be so.

10:45.308 --> 10:47.677 align:center line:81%
It will always be the Lord

10:47.677 --> 10:52.382 align:center line:79%
who chooses his servants
in the name of Jesus Christ,

10:52.582 --> 10:53.583 align:center line:81%
amen.

